# Built MEX gateways (keynub.build). Platform- and release-specific binaries are
# packaging artifacts, not source; a release ships them prebuilt so customers
# need no compiler. The folder itself is tracked so keynub.internal.call can
# point at it in its "not built yet" message.
*.mexw64
*.mexw32
*.mexa64
*.mexmaci64
*.mexmaca64
*.pdb
*.exp
*.lib
